From 713be07ab5afcf16e1ff0b44fd85a0afd26244ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bentclick <338634745+bentclick@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:33:06 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] BentClick build: remove the ArtCraft marks (brand licence
 for modified versions)

Drops the ArtCraft Discord and website entries from the Help menu, the command list, the top bar and the About dialog, and their translations. The About dialog says, in plain text, that this build is based on LightCraft by the ArtCraft team.
